      "content": "That's exactly the kind of angle I'm looking for. It's basically saying their \"concerns\" are just marketing for their monopoly. \n\nTo wrap up the script, I want a strong closing statement. Can you write a concluding paragraph for the podcast episode that summarizes why the Right to Repair is the only way to truly empower consumers and break the stranglehold these corporations have on our technology? I want it to sound really impactful and convincing.",
